---
---Archives the environment under the same If-Match precondition as a replace (428 missing, 412 stale). Send no body, or an empty object. The version does not change but the ETag does; history stays readable, the record leaves the default list, and further writes, including a second archive, return 409. Archiving an environment that an unarchived agent references, enabled or not, returns 409. Requires canManageAgents (automation principals require project write or manage). Route requests to the project's API URL returned by Core.
---
