---Bind a runner to a self-hosted Environment
---
---Lets the service account claim the runs of every agent in the Environment, and the managed Environment holds every self-hosted agent of the project, so this reaches the whole project. Idempotent: binding an active binding again changes nothing. The account's scope is its Core grants; entire-api does not inspect them. 409 when the Environment is archived. 422 when the Environment is not self_hosted (environment_not_self_hosted) or the account does not belong to the Environment's project. Requires project admin (403 otherwise). Route requests to the project's API URL returned by Core.
---
---`PUT /api/v1/{host}/{project}/environments/{id}/runners/{service_account_id}`
