---Create an environment
---
---Saves a new environment in the project at version 1 and returns it with its JSON etag write token, HTTP ETag and Location. Saving runs nothing. It belongs to the project and can be reused across its repositories and agents. Idempotency-Key is required: a retry with the same key and body saves nothing and returns the environment the first attempt saved, at its current version, with Idempotency-Replayed: true; the same key with a different body returns 409. A key is scoped to the caller, the project and environments, and does not expire. Bodies use the typed request schema; unknown fields, including spec wrappers and server-owned fields, are refused. Requires canManageAgents (automation principals require project write or manage). Route requests to the project's API URL returned by Core.
